<p class="p1"><span class="s1">Genie Lending were able to put together an unsecured revolving credit facility of £25,000 that can be drawn down and paid back at anytime during the life of the facility. Interest is charged daily and only on any outstanding balance so there is no long-term commitment and you only pay for what you borrow.</span></p>
