<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="burnsidefin://burnsidefin.com/blog/value-customer-retention-repeat-business-smes">The value in customer retention and repeat business for SME’s</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="burnsidefin://burnsidefin.com">Genie Lending: Business Loan Alternative Finance Specialists</a>.</p>
